url: "https://github.com/Jcarlosmiguel/omero-TinyMCE-Moodle"
abstract: "A four-component Moodle plugin suite (local_omeroembed, tiny_omeroembed, qtype_omerohotspot, qtype_omerohotspotmulti) that lets teachers embed enrolment-gated OMERO.iviewer whole-slide microscopy images directly into course content, with student annotations, click-to-answer hotspot quiz questions, and a teacher-facing view-activity heatmap - with no HTML or URL typing, no OMERO account for students, and no public/unauthenticated OMERO access."
keywords:
  - Moodle
  - OMERO
  - "virtual microscopy"
  - "digital pathology"
  - histology
  - TinyMCE
  - "dental education"
  - "quiz question type"
  - "e-learning"
